+The covariance matrix $\Sigma_i$ is computed from scale and rotation: $\Sigma_i = R_i S_i S_i^T R_i^T$, where $R_i$ is the rotation matrix derived from $q_i$ and $S_i$ is the diagonal scale matrix [S2].
